(Individual sedentary activities and cognitive function in middle-aged and older ) Tj T*
(adults: A systematic review) Tj T*
/F2 10 Tf
14 TL
() Tj T*
(Chen J, Dillon-Rossiter K, Grigsby-Duffy L, Morava A, Novic A, Salmani B, Smith S, Prapavessis ) Tj T*
(H, Gardiner PA. Journal of Alzheimer's Disease. 2026 Jan; 109\(2\):545-593 \(published online 22 ) Tj T*
